# Example v: a humanoid robot pours tea in a kitchen using both hands.
# Cleaned up from spec-source/URITP - Google Docs.pdf, following spec/DECISIONS.md:
#   A13 counter.spot_a became places.counter_spot_a
# mug and kettle are objects the robot finds with its own sensors (D4).
# The hands are both frames (for move) and actuators (for grip) (D8).

robot helper = connect("home:humanoid")
move helper.base to places.counter
move helper.right_hand to mug.handle
grip helper.right_hand close
move helper.left_hand to kettle.handle
grip helper.left_hand close

pour from kettle into mug until mug.fill >= 80%
place kettle on places.counter_spot_a using helper.left_hand
say "Your tea is ready"
